@startuml
' Gane-Sarson Level-1 DFD for Spring Boot backend.
' The rendered PNG (dataFlowDiagram.png) uses Gane-Sarson shapes
' matching: Process (rounded + header), External Entity (rectangle),
' Data Store (open rectangle with double left bar), Data Flow (labeled arrow).
' This .puml file documents the same logical model.

title Spring Boot Backend — Level-1 Data Flow Diagram\n(Gane-Sarson notation)

rectangle "Frontend Client" as Client
rectangle "OAuth\n(Google / GitHub)" as OAuth
rectangle "Mail Server\n(SMTP / IMAP)" as Mail
rectangle "RabbitMQ" as MQ
rectangle "Gemini API" as Gemini
rectangle "Google Drive" as Drive

rectangle "1.0\n----\nAuthenticate &\nManage Users" as P1
rectangle "2.0\n----\nShop &\nOrders" as P2
rectangle "3.0\n----\nProcess\nEmail" as P3
rectangle "4.0\n----\nGroup\nChat" as P4
rectangle "5.0\n----\nManage\nEmployees" as P5
rectangle "6.0\n----\nAI &\nDrive" as P6
rectangle "7.0\n----\nAdmin\nOperations" as P7

collections "D1 Users & Roles" as D1
collections "D2 Catalog / Cart / Orders" as D2
collections "D3 Email & Templates" as D3
collections "D4 Chat Groups" as D4
collections "D5 Employees & History" as D5
collections "D6 Files (uploads)" as D6
collections "D7 Logs & Settings" as D7

Client <--> P1 : credentials / JWT
Client <--> P2 : cart / checkout
Client <--> P3 : compose / inbox
Client <--> P4 : chat REST / WS
Client <--> P5 : employee CRUD
Client <--> P6 : prompts / files
Client <--> P7 : admin requests

OAuth <--> P1 : OAuth profile
P3 <--> Mail : send / fetch mail
P3 --> MQ : email jobs
MQ --> P3 : queued emails
P7 --> MQ : test message
P6 <--> Gemini : prompt / reply
P6 <--> Drive : list / upload / download

P1 <--> D1 : users / roles
P1 --> D6 : avatars
P2 <--> D2 : stock / cart / orders
P2 --> D6 : stock images
P3 <--> D3 : email records
P3 --> D6 : attachments
P4 <--> D4 : groups / messages
P5 <--> D5 : employees / history
P5 --> D6 : ID proofs
P7 <--> D7 : logs / settings
P7 <--> D3 : templates
P7 <--> D1 : user admin
P7 <--> D6 : serve images

legend right
  |= Shape |= Meaning |
  | Rounded box with header | Process |
  | Rectangle | External Entity |
  | Open store (|| name) | Data Store |
  | Labeled arrow | Data Flow |
endlegend

@enduml
